  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fiscal Policy Strengthening Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Fortalecimiento de la Poltica Fiscal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general de desarrollo del Programa es contribuir a la sostenibilidad fiscal de Argentina. Los objetivos especficos de desarrollo sern: (a) incrementar la eficiencia del sistema tributario; y (b) incrementar la eficiencia asignativa del gasto pblico.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general development objective of the Program is to contribute to the fiscal sustainability of Argentina. The specific development objectives will be: (a) increase the efficiency of the tax system; and (b) increase the allocative efficiency of public spending.</narrative>
  </description>
